{"id":"c29","stage":4,"title":"理解文化差异","scene":"避免以单一经历概括整个群体。","roles":["敏智","你"],"lines":[{"id":"c29-1","ko":"문화 차이를 설명할 때 무엇을 조심해야 할까요?","zh":"解释文化差异时，应注意什么？","note":"조심하다：小心、注意。","words":[{"term":"문화","zh":"文化","id":"580bb8d061b97e66","audio":"/audio/580bb8d061b97e66f221.mp3"},{"term":"무엇","zh":"什么","id":"c95167f3fe21887b","audio":"/audio/c95167f3fe21887b7320.mp3"},{"term":"조심하다","zh":"注意","id":"0ae97bed98d1be70","audio":"/audio/0ae97bed98d1be70547e.mp3"}],"audio":"/audio/c32b60ed106a149000c5.mp3","speakerIndex":0,"parts":[{"text":"문화","meaning":"文化","explanation":"문화修饰차이。","readings":[{"term":"문화","audio":"/audio/580bb8d061b97e66f221.mp3"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"문화","audio":"/audio/580bb8d061b97e66f221.mp3"}},{"text":"차이를","meaning":"差异","explanation":"차이（差异）+ 를（宾格）。","readings":[{"term":"차이를","audio":"/audio/9b811340f24c74d829ad.mp3"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"차이를","audio":"/audio/9b811340f24c74d829ad.mp3"}},{"text":"설명할","meaning":"解释","explanation":"설명하다（解释）+ -ㄹ，修饰때。","readings":[{"term":"설명할","audio":"/audio/5805a44c2c358a3721d0.mp3"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"설명할","audio":"/audio/5805a44c2c358a3721d0.mp3"}},{"text":"때","meaning":"时","explanation":"때（时候）；-ㄹ 때为时间结构。","readings":[{"term":"때","audio":"/audio/43bc9c47e0f938b11288.mp3"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"때","audio":"/audio/43bc9c47e0f938b11288.mp3"}},{"text":"무엇을","meaning":"什么","explanation":"무엇（什么）+ 을（宾格）。","readings":[{"term":"무엇","audio":"/audio/c95167f3fe21887b7320.mp3"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"무엇을","audio":"/audio/24dedd16c140f1fef242.mp3"}},{"text":"조심해야","meaning":"应该注意","explanation":"조심하다（小心、注意）+ -아/어야（必须）。","readings":[{"term":"조심하다","audio":"/audio/0ae97bed98d1be70547e.mp3"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"조심해야","audio":"/audio/a98043c4d0241df0df6a.mp3"}},{"text":"할까요?","meaning":"应该……呢？","explanation":"하다 + -ㄹ까요；与前文共同询问应当注意什么。","readings":[{"term":"할까요","audio":"/audio/289dd8e3438eab1f235b.mp3"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"할까요","audio":"/audio/289dd8e3438eab1f235b.mp3"}}]},{"id":"c29-2",