释","explanation":"설명하다（解释）+ -ㄹ，修饰때。","readings":[{"term":"설명할","audio":"/audio/5805a44c2c358a3721d0.mp3"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"설명할","audio":"/audio/5805a44c2c358a3721d0.mp3"}},{"text":"때","meaning":"时","explanation":"때是表示时间的依存名词。","readings":[{"term":"때","audio":"/audio/43bc9c47e0f938b11288.mp3"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"때","audio":"/audio/43bc9c47e0f938b11288.mp3"}},{"text":"오해를","meaning":"误解","explanation":"오해（误解）+ 를（宾格）。","readings":[{"term":"오해","audio":"/audio/a317fe4511680982e2e2.mp3"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"오해를","audio":"/audio/56290d55e787fa00986c.mp3"}},{"text":"줄일","meaning":"减少","explanation":"줄이다（减少）+ -ㄹ，修饰수。","readings":[{"term":"줄일","audio":"/audio/96c888ffcb5fe9c4c2c2.mp3"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"줄일","audio":"/audio/96c888ffcb5fe9c4c2c2.mp3"}},{"text":"수","meaning":"可能","explanation":"수与있다组成“能够”。","readings":[{"term":"수","audio":"/audio/dcd19f5b5caac9771378.mp3"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"수","audio":"/audio/dcd19f5b5caac9771378.mp3"}},{"text":"있어요.","meaning":"可以","explanation":"있다的礼貌形式；줄일 수 있다表示能减少。","readings":[{"term":"있어요","audio":"/audio/499f8423f214354759ff.mp3"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"있어요","audio":"/audio/499f8423f214354759ff.mp3"}}]}],"day":141,"sequenceScore":3.9267,"questions":[{"lineIndex":2,"options":["在同一社会内部，世代和情境不会造成差异。","只有在不同国家之间才会出现差异。","即使在同一社会内部，也会因世代和情境而不同。"],"answer":2},{"lineIndex":4,"options":["不能因为陌生，就断定它是错的。","因为陌生，就可以断定它是错的。","因为熟悉，就不能继续研究它。"],"answer":0}]}
